<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@/~cl_15__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (1)— (i) by inserting before the words \"for a laboratory test\" the words \"of blood or urine\"; and (ii) by inserting before the words \"medical practitioner\" the word \"registered\"; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@/~cl_15__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@/~cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@> .
