<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@/~cl_16> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 45F of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: \"(3) A specimen of blood shall be disregarded unless it was taken from the accused by a government medical officer; and evidence that a specimen of blood was so taken may be given by the production of a document purporting to certify that fact and signed by a government medical officer.\". Amendment of section 45G"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@> .
