<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@/~cl_22__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection: \"(5) For the purposes of this section, \"licence holder\" means a person licensed under paragraph (a), (b), (c), (d), (e), (f) or (g) of subsection (1) of section 14 or subsection (2) of section 14 of the Commercial Vehicles Licensing Board Act 1987.\". Amendment of section 113"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@> .
