<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@/~cl_25> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 116 the following section: \"jurisdiction 116A. Notwithstanding anything contained in any of court of written law to the contrary, a court of a First Class First Class Magistrate. Magistrate shall have the jurisdiction to try any offence under this Act and to award the full punishment for any such offence.\". Amendment of section 117"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/13/eng@> .
